Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:20.89,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I already decided that the first \Nperson I'd look at if I ever gained sight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.62,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,would be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:25.29,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The person I hate the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:29.38,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Unable to do anything alone, \Nand everything a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.37,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Always troubling people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:35.38,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I'd fall all the time and hurt myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:39.18,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The person I hate the \Nmost in the world: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:54.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So this is... me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm not dashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No beard, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:06.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, that's because I'm a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:12.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I had wondered if looking at my face \Nwould make me hate myself even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:16.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,or if perhaps it'd make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:19.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I am still me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:24.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's rather anticlimactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:29.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think I can \Ncome to like myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:34.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And... what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:16.96,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,KUNON THE SORCERER CAN SEE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I doubt it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:18.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is it you, Iko—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:19.97,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Did you call for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's immaterial?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:32.60,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:33.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:34.65,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:48.12,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes... Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:49.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is your hair in a braid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.15,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:53.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I didn't know maid outfits \Nsymbolized cleanliness so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:58.49,main,IKO,0,0,0,,A gentleman would first tell me that \Nit looks good on me and I look cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:02.88,main,IKO,0,0,0,,So you did it! You made it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.82,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:10.65,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you, Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:12.10,main - top,KUNON,0,0,0,,I feel dizzy! You'll make me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.10,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.94,main,IKO,0,0,0,,We should let your father know right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.34,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I must cook up a feast for tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:26.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Listen, aren't you in the mood \Nfor some creamy crab croquettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.87,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Is that your request? I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:34.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko, do you... have a horn on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:39.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No. I do when I get mad, but right \Nnow I'm happy so it's pulled in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:42.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:47.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Now I can see your charming \Nface and your sexy horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:51.02,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I'm glad I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:04.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So this is... scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:25.45,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's not what I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:29.26,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, it's still chilly outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.45,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone will be over the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:36.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:40.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,By the way, do you see \Nsomething behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:43.71,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh my! Is this a scary story? I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:44.69,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Let me hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:48.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.92,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What?! I'd love to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.06,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The experiment was a massive success.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:56.46,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Now I can see, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.56,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can see, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.09,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,You can see now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:03.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:04.73,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:05.71,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:09.42,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,I'm so glad! So glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.72,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:21.73,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:24.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:27.67,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Why do they look super cool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's just that you look so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.93,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Mother looks beautiful, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:36.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah! Like a heroine \Nfrom an epic adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.96,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm a \Nheroine, like a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.52,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Oh, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.25,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,No, the one holding the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:43.74,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Do I look cool, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:45.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do your parents happen to be \Nfallen angels by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:55.89,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,They are your parents, too, \Nso you know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I do know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:03.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Say, Iko, are there humans \Nwith wings in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:07.54,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Every single one of us is born with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:10.06,main,IKO,0,0,0,,By spreading the wings called \Nfreedom and potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:12.03,main,IKO,0,0,0,,we can soar into the sky of the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:15.69,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,But as we get older, \Nwe forget how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:20.01,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,Until a few years ago... I mean, \NI'm still young and fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:14.42,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The crab, the horn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:17.99,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,the eyes of a heroine from an adventure \Nand the wings of a fallen angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:21.92,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,They are immaterial, \Nand only I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:23.66,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.55,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Kunon! Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.74,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Oh, Father has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:34.05,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Both Mother and Brother are the badass \Ntype, so Father must also be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:38.56,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Finally... Finally, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.93,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I don't even understand what he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:45.02,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Darling! That's right. \NKunon finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:48.10,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Well done! Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:49.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Tonight, we celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:52.54,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,We must send word to the castle, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:56.65,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Let's decorate with a lot of beautiful \Nflowers Kunon can enjoy looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:08:00.83,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm going to cook tons of creamy \Ncrab croquettes, so you just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:04.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:05.51,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:09.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is a father usually like \Nfog within a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:11.35,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Don't ever say that out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.22,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,You'll make Father cry for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.73,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I'll ask my master for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.24,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:33.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Who said you could enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:38.46,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. This is my first time seeing \Nthe floor of Mr. Zeon's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.13,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,We can't thank Kunon enough, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:42.12,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:45.37,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,State your business. Otherwise, begone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:49.30,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Grand Master's message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:52.88,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,His Majesty has granted you permission \Nto go outside, so you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:53.80,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.22,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Apparently there's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.30,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Is it Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:05.27,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.98,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.78,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sister Raysha told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:21.08,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,You finally made your dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:25.78,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:29.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. It's the eye of mirrors \Nthat reflects everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm calling it the Glass Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.80,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Will you take a look at my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.09,0:09:38.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, it'd be my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've worked hard so I can \Nsee Your Highness's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:46.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm just so excited, my heart \Nis bouncing like a young boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:49.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am a young boy, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:03.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Gorgeous blonde like the \Nrays of the morning sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Ice blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:11.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're just as beautiful as \NI imagined, if not more...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.25,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.59,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.84,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Am I not your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That will never be true when \Nit comes to you, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're more than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:25.22,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:28.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, you're just like a \Nfeather of a beautiful bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.26,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,A feather?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:33.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He means the wings of \Nfreedom and potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:36.30,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If the young and fresh Princess \NMirika is flying freely in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:40.99,main,IKO,0,0,0,,a large, middle-aged man with a beard \Nwill come catch you in a silver cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.99,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,As always, your analogy is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:48.02,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Right now, Your Highness has \Nthe skill to take down a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.12,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,large, middle-aged man \Nwith a beard in one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.13,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Um... that's a very cool sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:02.14,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,This? It's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.71,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Sure, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:06.87,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Sir Dario is also the badass type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.14,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Yo, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:13.54,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Now you're summoning me. Look at \Nyou moving up the ladder, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.90,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,And who the heck do we have here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Uh... Are you my master?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:22.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can't see you well \Nbecause you're too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:25.08,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Too bright? Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.68,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I am always shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.55,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:32.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not quite what I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.98,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Sir Dario has a white great sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.09,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Master's whole body is shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.05,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Maybe a similar type to Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.30,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I am seeing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:46.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master. Agh! No, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:50.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master, there's something \NI'd like to discuss alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.80,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make sense at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.31,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You have a giant crab with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:07.11,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And Dario has a ginormous blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:10.20,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And Her Highness has a quill \Nsticking out of her head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:13.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,From now on, when I ask for \NHer Highness's hand in marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:15.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,or move into a new residence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll be carrying a crab and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:19.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Her Highness will have a quill\Nsticking out of her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.97,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Your future plan is pretty solid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:26.31,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The colors of the scenery\Nyou see also seem different, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:29.47,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And you say I'm shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:36.32,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to admit \NI'm always shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:39.16,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Among humans, I'm the \Nbrightest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:41.74,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Obviously not as bright as the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nope, I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:44.23,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:46.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I really can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're so bright I can't \Nlook at you directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:03.60,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I have two guesses, primarily speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:04.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:08.89,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,One is the possibility where you're \Nseeing the shapes of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:11.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You mean something spiritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:14.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But then, that would \Nmean my soul is a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:18.08,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The other is the pattern where magic \Nsickness is causing visual hallucination.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sickness from magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:23.17,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Some locations can \Naccumulate magical power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:26.49,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,while other places can be \Npathways of magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:29.83,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I've been to one of those spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:37.33,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It rendered me useless, \Nlike I got drunk after too many drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:43.30,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,In the fading consciousness, \NI saw things that were immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:56.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Things that were immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:57.53,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Sounds similar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:58.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.34,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,But we can't determine which this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.11,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Not enough data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:07.25,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,If you see more, we might find a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Um, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.13,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:14.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Could this have been a failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:16.12,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.88,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Because it's the masterpiece \Nof my beloved student.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.51,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,There are many
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:29.77,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,creatures in nature that do not see \Ncolors, creatures with many eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.41,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,and creatures that can't see, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:36.39,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,No one knows what's the right way to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:41.90,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You can have your own \Nway of seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:45.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:52.03,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And who knows? Maybe what you see might \Nbe telling you something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.62,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,If it's really tough for you,\N you can seal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.54,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,But if not, keep on seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:14:59.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:02.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've only started to see, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:06.06,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,For now, don't tell anyone \Nthat you're seeing things
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:08.84,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,until you figure out the \Npattern and the conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:12.18,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,There may be people who find it strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm glad I asked for advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're still blinding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:20.11,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,My radiance is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:24.81,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,They're still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.80,main,IKO,0,0,0,,His eyeballs were just completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.28,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm sure he has much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.59,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm sure he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:37.01,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon's birthday is coming up soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.03,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:41.78,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What gift would make Kunon happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:46.21,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be happy with \Nanything from you, Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:50.22,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.61,0:15:56.71,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:58.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:02.75,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Come on, just imagining \Na quill sticking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.48,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:07.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing. Just a private \Nconversation with Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:10.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What were you talking to \NIko about, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:13.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,A private conversation. \NRight, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:14.66,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.46,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What would you like to \Ndo with these books?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:28.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I read them all, so I'll leave them \Nat the library of the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:36.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I never knew this room was so spacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:37.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:48.98,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon, happy 12th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:51.11,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:51.11,main - top,IXIO/ARSAN,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:58.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, Brother, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:06.50,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,It might be a bit heavy, \Nbut it's sturdy and will last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:09.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.30,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Here you go, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:14.28,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Study a lot with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.64,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Here's my gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:22.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A map for foodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:27.35,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Yeah, I looked up good restaurants \Non the way to the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:29.81,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Gotta have something to look \Nforward to on your trip, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:33.43,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,The school's pretty far away, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:38.27,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,It's very... far away, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:43.91,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon, you're moving so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:45.95,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,D-Don't you worry, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:48.04,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,He'll graduate in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.59,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:52.42,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Even if he's far away, \Nhe'll still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.05,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Right, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:55.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:18:00.68,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Come on, we're celebrating today. \NLet's enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:01.70,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.96,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Now, let us eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.30,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll start serving right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.32,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Are you finished preparing for your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:20.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm taking comfortable \Nclothes and bare necessities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:22.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Anything else I need, I will buy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:27.54,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I have school on the day you depart, \Nso I'm sorry I can't see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:32.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You have something you \Nmust do, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:33.46,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:39.29,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon, happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:43.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. May I open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:44.70,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:48.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A bracelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:50.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.47,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,It's a matching pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:59.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Matching with Your Highness, \Nit outshines any royal crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:01.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Even my master will have
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:04.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,wisdom tooth pain from the stress\Nif I shower him with this radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:09.27,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,If and when things get \Ntough at the magic school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:12.22,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,please speak to it like it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.81,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I will do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:14.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:22.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will write to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.76,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,As will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will come back to you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:29.94,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I will be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:33.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please be well until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:36.82,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Same to you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.62,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:02.99,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Let's see him off without tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:06.69,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's feeling \Nmore anxious than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.18,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:15.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay, bye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:16.86,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,So unconcerned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:20.13,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Doesn't he have more to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:22.61,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,No, that was very Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:24.60,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay, bye for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.12,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,So it came from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:30.24,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Kunon changed a lot because of that maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.68,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Changed in a good way, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:36.00,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,In a good way, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:46.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,See you! In two, three, \Nfour, or five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:49.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I'll come home in a few years!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:52.02,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Right. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.89,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.89,0:20:57.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I won't! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:10.60,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Magic school. I wonder what kinds \Nof sorcerers I'll meet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:27.18,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Wait up, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.24,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Let me hop on, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:40.53,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Saint Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:44.55,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,It is time to depart for the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.00,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: FAREWELLS\NAND HELLOS AND DIRASHIK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:39.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Farewells \Nand Hellos and Dirashik."
